; profile: step=one;store=set
; In a set store two firings need not commute: plant makes the row spend
; takes.  Planted first, the token is there already and spend takes it;
; spent first, plant makes it again.  The two orders end at different states.
(seed)
(token)
(rule plant (take (seed)) (make (token)))
(rule spend (take (token)) (make (spent)))
